\(K(t,s)=tK_C+sK_\star\). Exact symbolic traces satisfy

\[
 \operatorname{tr}K_\star=0,\qquad
 \operatorname{tr}K_C\ne0,\qquad
 \operatorname{tr}K(t,s)=t\,\operatorname{tr}K_C.       \tag{18}
\]

Any similarity taking \(K(t,s)\) to \(-K(t,s)\) would force its trace to
